led="false" aria-selected="false" class="button-base_8mdwa button-base-variant-borderless_lpDBw button-base-size-medium_mmXaT"><label class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-weight-medium_uOCpD button-text-content_-6GjM">Watch TikTok</label><i data-name="IconArrowRightFillLTR" class="icon_U6FAW"><svg fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="flip-rtl "><path d="m44.12 21.88-15.3-15.3a1 1 0 0 0-1.4 0L24.6 9.4a1 1 0 0 0 .02 1.43L35.26 21H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h30.26L24.62 37.17a1 1 0 0 0-.02 1.43l2.81 2.81a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l15.3-15.29a3 3 0 0 0 0-4.24Z"></path></svg></i></button></a></div></div></div></nav></div></header><div class="application-body-gutter_--9an"><div class="page-basic_LE-6F page-article_9YQqn"><section class="page-article-main_a42gf"><div data-tux-color-scheme="light" class="section-basic-layout_rYhNd"><div class="layout-container_CnlmO layout-container-gutter-tight_PbG7d section-basic-container_ww0Ia"><div class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-normal_tudh6 layout-space-direction-horizontal_dgmwE layout-space-align-start_ASzuJ layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO page-article-main-layout_BGkN1"><div class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-none_CqhU4 layout-space-direction-vertical_Bd64T layout-space-align-center_Sqq0i layout-space-justify-space-between_gLpfM page-article-main-left_VXlrY"><a class="navigation-base_dmAJS" href="/?lang=en-AU"><button type="button" aria-disabled="false" aria-selected="false" class="button-base_8mdwa button-base-variant-outlined_nnEDF button-icon_UKv45 button-icon-size-medium_g-ksM"><i data-name="IconArrowLeftLTR" class="icon_U6FAW icon-size-medium_KbOiA"><svg fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="flip-rtl "><path d="m4.59 22.59 15.29-15.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.41 0l1.42 1.42a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.41L10.83 22H43a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H10.83L22.7 37.88a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.41l-1.42 1.42a1 1 0 0 1-1.41 0L4.58 25.4a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.82Z"></path></svg></i></button></a></div><div class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-super-loose_0GtAV layout-space-direction-vertical_Bd64T layout-space-align-start_ASzuJ layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO page-article-main-body_QXExr"><div class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-normal_tudh6 layout-space-direction-vertical_Bd64T layout-space-align-start_ASzuJ layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO"><div class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-tight_-mMQk layout-space-direction-horizontal_dgmwE layout-space-align-center_Sqq0i layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO"><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-color-text2_SWzBr article-basic-date-time_4iM-o">September 14, 2026</span><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-color-text2_SWzBr">•</span><span class="article-basic-tags_VMnbM"><a class="navigation-base_dmAJS article-basic-tags-item_rhSY5" href="/?tag=news&amp;lang=en-AU"><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-color-text2_SWzBr">News</span></a><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-color-text2_SWzBr article-basic-tags-separator_0tbi0">,<!-- --> </span><a class="navigation-base_dmAJS article-basic-tags-item_rhSY5" href="/?tag=product&amp;lang=en-AU"><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-color-text2_SWzBr">Product</span></a></span></div><h1 class="typography-title_9cuu5 typography-title-heading-3_AYfhY typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-weight-medium_uOCpD">TikTok and Amplify launch new creator-led content series for brands</h1></div><div class="page-article-main-content_Jv3t2 rich-text-content-spacing_-0bcp"><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">TikTok and Amplify have joined forces to announce <strong>The Next Episode</strong>, a new content initiative designed to help brands move beyond traditional short-form content and invest in creator-led series.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">As demand for longer-form, episodic entertainment continues to grow, the new initiative connects brands with Amplify&#x27;s creator network to develop and produce original, social-first series, with eligible brands able to access production support through TikTok alongside their media investment.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">Micro-dramas, interviews, game shows, docuseries and reality shows transform the way brands show up on TikTok, giving them a recurring presence and ability to build deeper relationships with audiences over time.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">The Next Episode represents a new way for brands to shift from appearing in content, to working with creators to shape ongoing moments and conversations that connect with audiences and drive long-term engagement.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">Brands can invest in a <strong>Creator Content Series</strong> that integrates them into the world of a TikTok creator&#x27;s episodic content, or they can take centre stage in their own creator-led <strong>Brand Content Series.</strong></p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">&quot;TikTok has always been a place where new formats of storytelling emerge and audiences discover what they want to watch next. We’re now seeing that evolve into short-form, episodic storytelling, where creators can build worlds, characters and narratives that audiences want to come back to again and again,&quot; said <strong>Amy Bradshaw, General Manager for Global Business Solutions, TikTok Australia and New Zealand</strong>.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">&quot;The Next Episode gives brands a way to be part of that shift, moving beyond one-off moments into creator-led series that can build sustained engagement over time. By bringing together creator credibility, premium storytelling and TikTok’s discovery engine, we’re giving brands a new way to turn entertainment and attention into meaningful business impact.&quot;</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">As creators increasingly evolve beyond short-form social content into original entertainment and longer-form storytelling, this initiative fosters new career pathways and monetisation opportunities for creators and the production industry.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">&quot;Creators understand their audience better than anyone, and The Next Episode gives them the opportunity to take that expertise into bigger, more ambitious storytelling,&quot; said <strong>Tom Maynard, Amplify Co-Founder</strong>.</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">&quot;It gives creators the opportunity to build distinctive, recurring worlds and formats, while opening up new ways to collaborate with brands, grow their audiences and create scalable opportunities from their ideas.&quot;</p><p class="typography-base_b8SoO" style="margin:0;padding:0">Prior to The Next Episode, TikTok and Amplify have collaborated on a number of branded content series, including The TikTok Road Trip (presented by Kia), Gatorade Games (Gatorade) and Love Songs (Tinder).</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><footer><nav class="sitemap_Y4EdV application-sitemap_--u9w"><div class="layout-container_CnlmO layout-container-gutter-tight_PbG7d"><ul class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-none_CqhU4 layout-space-direction-horizontal_dgmwE layout-space-align-stretch_7wJJL layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO layout-grid_d3qhl layout-grid-gap-horizontal-normal_lavWS layout-grid-gap-vertical-normal_vBo4L"><li style="width:20%"><div><span class="typography-base_b8SoO typography-base-weight-medium_uOCpD sitemap-group-title_TEPdE">Language</span><ul class="layout-space_6GsJx layout-space-gap-none_CqhU4 layout-space-direction-horizontal_dgmwE layout-space-align-start_ASzuJ layout-space-justify-start_uYvGO layout-grid_d3qhl layout-grid-gap-horizontal-non