%22displayName%22%3A%22Urdu%22%2C%22localizedDisplayName%22%3A%22%D8%A7%D8%B1%D8%AF%D9%88%22%2C%22textDirection%22%3A%22rtl%22%7D%2C%7B%22locale%22%3A%22vi-VN%22%2C%22displayName%22%3A%22Vietnamese%22%2C%22localizedDisplayName%22%3A%22Ti%E1%BA%BFng%20Vi%E1%BB%87t%22%2C%22textDirection%22%3A%22ltr%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%22error%22%3A%7B%22title%22%3A%22Server%20issue%20detected%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Thanks%20for%20your%20patience%20while%20we%20fix%20it.%22%2C%22beforeText%22%3A%22Oops...%22%2C%22actions%22%3A%5B%7B%22href%22%3A%22%2F%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Back%20to%20home%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22notFound%22%3A%7B%22title%22%3A%22Page%20not%20found%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22The%20page%20you're%20looking%20for%20is%20currently%20unavailable%20or%20doesn't%20exist.%20Let's%20head%20back%20home.%22%2C%22beforeText%22%3A%22Oops...%22%2C%22actions%22%3A%5B%7B%22href%22%3A%22%2F%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22Back%20to%20home%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%22routes%2F_app.%24id%22%3A%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fnewsroom.tiktok.com%2Ftiktok-and-amplify-launch-new-creator-led-content-series-for-brands%3Flang%3Den-AU%22%2C%22referrer%22%3A%22%22%2C%22article%22%3A%7B%22data%22%3A%7B%22content%22%3A%22%3Cp%3ETikTok%20and%20Amplify%20have%20joined%20forces%20to%20announce%20%3Cstrong%3EThe%20Next%20Episode%3C%2Fstrong%3E%2C%20a%20new%20content%20initiative%20designed%20to%20help%20brands%20move%20beyond%20traditional%20short-form%20content%20and%20invest%20in%20creator-led%20series.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20demand%20for%20longer-form%2C%20episodic%20entertainment%20continues%20to%20grow%2C%20the%20new%20initiative%20connects%20brands%20with%20Amplify's%20creator%20network%20to%20develop%20and%20produce%20original%2C%20social-first%20series%2C%20with%20eligible%20brands%20able%20to%20access%20production%20support%20through%20TikTok%20alongside%20their%20media%20investment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMicro-dramas%2C%20interviews%2C%20game%20shows%2C%20docuseries%20and%20reality%20shows%20transform%20the%20way%20brands%20show%20up%20on%20TikTok%2C%20giving%20them%20a%20recurring%20presence%20and%20ability%20to%20build%20deeper%20relationships%20with%20audiences%20over%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Next%20Episode%20represents%20a%20new%20way%20for%20brands%20to%20shift%20from%20appearing%20in%20content%2C%20to%20working%20with%20creators%20to%20shape%20ongoing%20moments%20and%20conversations%20that%20connect%20with%20audiences%20and%20drive%20long-term%20engagement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBrands%20can%20invest%20in%20a%20%3Cstrong%3ECreator%20Content%20Series%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20that%20integrates%20them%20into%20the%20world%20of%20a%20TikTok%20creator's%20episodic%20content%2C%20or%20they%20can%20take%20centre%20stage%20in%20their%20own%20creator-led%20%3Cstrong%3EBrand%20Content%20Series.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%5C%22TikTok%20has%20always%20been%20a%20place%20where%20new%20formats%20of%20storytelling%20emerge%20and%20audiences%20discover%20what%20they%20want%20to%20watch%20next.%20We%E2%80%99re%20now%20seeing%20that%20evolve%20into%20short-form%2C%20episodic%20storytelling%2C%20where%20creators%20can%20build%20worlds%2C%20characters%20and%20narratives%20that%20audiences%20want%20to%20come%20back%20to%20again%20and%20again%2C%5C%22%20said%20%3Cstrong%3EAmy%20Bradshaw%2C%20General%20Manager%20for%20Global%20Business%20Solutions%2C%20TikTok%20Australia%20and%20New%20Zealand%3C%2Fstrong%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%5C%22The%20Next%20Episode%20gives%20brands%20a%20way%20to%20be%20part%20of%20that%20shift%2C%20moving%20beyond%20one-off%20moments%20into%20creator-led%20series%20that%20can%20build%20sustained%20engagement%20over%20time.%20By%20bringing%20together%20creator%20credibility%2C%20premium%20storytelling%20and%20TikTok%E2%80%99s%20discovery%20engine%2C%20we%E2%80%99re%20giving%20brands%20a%20new%20way%20to%20turn%20entertainment%20and%20attention%20into%20meaningful%20business%20impact.%5C%22%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20creators%20increasingly%20evolve%20beyond%20short-form%20social%20content%20into%20original%20entertainment%20and%20longer-form%20storytelling%2C%20this%20initiative%20fosters%20new%20career%20pathways%20and%20monetisation%20opportunities%20for%20creators%20and%20the%20production%20industry.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%5C%22Creators%20understand%20their%20audience%20better%20than%20anyone%2C%20and%20The%20Next%20Episode%20gives%20them%20the%20opportunity%20to%20take%20that%20expertise%20into%20bigger%2C%20more%20ambitious%20storytelling%2C%5C%22%20said%20%3Cstrong%3ETom%20Maynard%2C%20Amplify%20Co-Founder%3C%2Fstrong%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%5C%22It%20gives%20creators%20the%20opportunity%20to%20build%20distinctive%2C%20recurring%20worlds%20and%20formats%2C%20while%20opening%20up%20new%20ways%20to%20collaborate%20with%20brands%2C%20grow%20their%20audiences%20and%20create%20scalable%20opportunities%20from%20their%20ideas.%5C%22%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPrior%20to%20The%20Next%20Episode%2C%20TikTok%20and%20Amplify%20have%20collaborated%20on%20a%20number%20of%20branded%20content%20series%2C%20including%20The%20TikTok%20Road%20Trip%20(presented%20by%20Kia)%2C%20Gatorade%20Games%20(Gatorade)%20and%20Love%20Songs%20(Tinder).%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22cover%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22Bold%20Dawn%20Solid%22%2C%22regionUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fp16-ttark.tiktokcdn-us.com%2Ftos-useast5-i-1rzkm2vceq-tx%2F23496c2c0f96b1c520fb79f758c1bc63.png~tplv-1rzkm2vceq-default%3A0%3A0%3Aq75.image%22%7D%2C%22region%22%3A%22Australia%22%2C%22sharingChannels%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22tags%22%3A%5B%22news%22%2C%22product%22%5D%2C%22title%22%3A%22TikTok%20and%20Amplify%20launch%20new%20creator-led%20content%20series%20for%20brands%22%2C%22publishedDate%22%3A%222026-09-14T03%3A04%3A40.119Z%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tiktok-and-amplify-launch-new-creator-led-content-series-for-brands%22%7D%7D%2C%22tags%22%3A%7B%22total%22%3A6%2C%22limit%22%3A6%2C%22skip%22%3A0%2C%22data%22%3A%5B%7B%22label%22%3A%22All%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22all%22%7D%2C%7B%22label%22%3A%22Community%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22community%22%7D%2C%7B%22label%22%3A%2